raccolti da Michelle e il ritorno di Vincent (Pierre Lottin), il figlio di Marie-Claude appena uscito di prigione, sembra sconvolgere ulteriormente gli equilibri..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"When Fall Is Coming","overview":"Michelle is enjoying a peaceful retirement in a Burgundy village, close to her longtime friend Marie-Claude. When her Parisian daughter Valérie drops off her son Lucas to spend school vacation with his grandma, Michelle, stressed out by her daughter, serves her toxic mushrooms for lunch. Valérie quickly recovers, but forbids her mother from seeing her grandson anymore. Feeling lonely and guilty, Michelle falls into a depression... until Marie-Claude's son gets out of prison."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Michelle, une grand-mère bien sous tous rapports, vit sa retraite paisible dans un petit village de Bourgogne, pas loin de sa meilleure amie Marie-Claude. À la Toussaint, sa fille Valérie vient lui rendre visite et déposer son fils Lucas pour la semaine de vacances. Mais rien ne se passe comme prévu."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ylFpYGIoplBBtJn6CoaQAyoRyQB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z3zeYgp8P8SqTypwatOHINDCnHM.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1171634,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ylFpYGIoplBBtJn6CoaQAyoRyQB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ylFpYGIoplBBtJn6CoaQAyoRyQB.jpg","language":"it","width":1392,"height":2088},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ylFpYGIoplBBtJn6CoaQAyoRyQB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ylFpYGIoplBBtJn6CoaQAyoRyQB.jpg","language":"it","width":1392,"height":2088}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/ori